member.summary:
Returns true if any branch plant records (F0006) exist which
have open cycle counts in the Enterprise 1 cycle count detail
table (F4141) 


Example of use:



     _BranchPlantTable.ResetAll();

    _BranchPlantTable.DisplayBranchesWithCycleCounts();

    _BranchPlantList.Show();

