member.returns:
Returns true if any UOM conversions are fetched for the branch plant and short
            item number specified and the blank branch plant and short item number specified;
            otherwise, false.

Returns true if records are fetched for the Branch, Document Number, and Document
            Type specified where the status is within the array of allowed statuses specified;
            otherwise, false.

member.summary:
Given an array of allowed next status codes (defined in workflow options
for workflow using this method), the document number, type, and line number (optional),
return all open lines for this order

member.returns:
True if any records are fetched that match the criteria specified for
            status codes, document number, document type, line number, and having open quantity;
            otherwise, false

member.summary:
Given an array of allowed next status codes (defined in workflow options
for workflow using this method), the document number, type, line number (optional),
and branch plant (optional), return all open lines for this order

member.returns:
True if any records are fetched that match the criteria specified for
            status codes, branch plant (optional), short item number, and having open quantity;
            otherwise, false
